<title>SPAIN: Spain 1-yr, 18-mo bill yields rise at auction.</title>
<headline>Spain 1-yr, 18-mo bill yields rise at auction.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-06-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Spain announced the following results at today's Treasury debt auction (amounts bid, allocated in billions of pesetas):</p>
<p>ISSUE     Yield   Pvs   Price    Pvs     Bid   Allocated</p>
<p> 1-year   5.030  4.975  95.16    95.21  256.532  215.782</p>
<p>18-months 5.050  5.005  92.80    92.86  270.696  128.800</p>
<p>-- Madrid Newsroom, + 341 585 8340</p>
</text>
